{"suttaId":"sn14.17","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-ii","vriCode":"s0302m.mul","paras":[763,767],"vripara":"101"},"segments":{"sn14.17:0.3":"Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttaṃ","sn14.17:1.1":"Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … pe …","sn14.17:1.2":"“dhātusova, bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:1.3":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.4":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.5":"anottappino anottappīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.6":"appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.7":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.8":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:1.9":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti”.","sn14.17:2.1":"“Atītampi kho, bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu.","sn14.17:2.2":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.3":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.4":"anottappino anottappīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.5":"appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.6":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.7":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu;","sn14.17:2.8":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandiṃsu samiṃsu.","sn14.17:3.1":"“Anāgatampi kho, bhikkhave, addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandissanti samessanti.","sn14.17:3.2":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandissanti samessanti;","sn14.17:3.3":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ saṃsandissanti samessanti;","sn14.17:3.4":"anottappino anottappīhi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:3.5":"appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:3.6":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:3.7":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:3.8":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandissanti samessanti.","sn14.17:4.1":"“Etarahipi kho, bhikkhave, paccuppannaṃ addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:4.2":"Assaddhā assaddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:4.3":"ahirikā ahirikehi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:4.4":"anottappino anottappīhi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:4.5":"appassutā appassutehi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:4.6":"kusītā kusītehi saddhiṃ … pe …","sn14.17:4.7":"muṭṭhassatino muṭṭhassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:4.8":"duppaññā duppaññehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:5.1":"“Dhātusova, bhikkhave, sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:5.2":"Saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.3":"hirimanā hirimanehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.4":"ottappino ottappīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.5":"bahussutā bahussutehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.6":"āraddhavīriyā āraddhavīriyehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.7":"upaṭṭhitassatino upaṭṭhitassatīhi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.8":"paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:5.9":"Atītampi kho, bhikkhave, addhānaṃ … pe …","sn14.17:5.10":"anāgatampi kho, bhikkhave … pe …","sn14.17:5.11":"etarahipi kho, bhikkhave, paccuppannaṃ addhānaṃ dhātusova sattā saṃsandanti samenti.","sn14.17:5.12":"Saddhā saddhehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samenti;","sn14.17:5.13":"paññavanto paññavantehi saddhiṃ saṃsandanti samentī”ti.","sn14.17:5.14":"Sattamaṃ."},"unsure":["sn14.17:5.12"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0302a.att","from":554,"to":554,"paras":[{"para":554,"vripara":"101","refs":["sn14.17:1"],"lines":["Sattame <b>assaddhā assaddhehī</b>tiādīsu buddhe vā dhamme vā saṅghe vā saddhāvirahitā nirojā nirasā puggalā samuddassa orimatīre ṭhitā pārimatīrepi ṭhitehi assaddhehi saddhiṃ tāya assaddhatāya ekasadisā nirantarā honti.","Tathā ahirikā bhinnamariyādā alajjipuggalā ahirikehi, anottappino pāpakiriyāya abhāyamānā anottappīhi, appassutā sutavirahitā appassutehi, kusītā ālasiyapuggalā kusītehi, muṭṭhassatino bhattanikkhittakākamaṃsanikkhittasiṅgālasadisā muṭṭhassatīhi, duppaññā khandhādiparicchedikāya paññāya abhāvena nippaññā tādiseheva duppaññehi, saddhāsampannā cetiyavandanādikiccapasutā saddhehi, hirimanā lajjipuggalā hirimanehi, ottappino pāpabhīrukā ottappīhi, bahussutā sutadharā āgamadharā tantipālakā vaṃsānurakkhakā bahussutehi, āraddhavīriyā paripuṇṇaparakkamā āraddhavīriyehi, upaṭṭhitassatī sabbakiccapariggāhikāya satiyā samannāgatā upaṭṭhitassatīhi, paññavanto mahāpaññehi vajirūpamañāṇehi paññavantehi saddhiṃ dūre ṭhitāpi tāya paññāsampattiyā saṃsandanti samenti.","Sattamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn14.17:1.3","assaddhā assaddhehī",0,0]],"before":[{"para":553,"vripara":null,"title":"Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā"]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-ii","bookName":"Nidānavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0302t.tik","from":557,"to":557,"paras":[{"para":557,"vripara":"101","refs":["sn14.17:1","sn14.17:5"],"lines":["<b>Nirojā</b>ti saddhāsnehābhāvena nisnehā.","Tato eva arasabhāvena <b>nirasā.</b>","<b>Ekasadisā</b>ti samasamā nibbisesā.","Tenāha <b>“nirantarā”</b>ti.","Alajjitāya ekasīmakatā <b>bhinnamariyādā</b>.","Saddhā tesaṃ atthīti <b>saddhā.</b>","<b>Tantipālakā</b>ti saddhammatantiyā pālakā.","<b>Vaṃsānurakkhakā</b>ti ariyavaṃsassa anurakkhakā.","<b>Āraddhavīriyā</b>ti paggahitavīriyā.","Yasmā tādisānaṃ vīriyaṃ paripuṇṇaṃ nāma hoti kiccasiddhiyā, tasmā vuttaṃ <b>“paripuṇṇaparakkamā”</b>ti.","<b>Sabbakiccapariggāhikāyā</b>ti catunnaṃ satipaṭṭhānānaṃ bhāvanākiccapariggāhikāya."],"lineRefs":[["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:1"],["sn14.17:5"],["sn14.17:5"],["sn14.17:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn14.17:1.3","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.4","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.5","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.6","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.7","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.8","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:1.9","saddhā",0,5],["sn14.17:5.6","āraddhavīriyā",0,8]],"before":[{"para":556,"vripara":null,"title":"Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā"]}],"after":[{"para":558,"vripara":null,"title":"Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā","lines":["Assaddhasaṃsandanasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]}]},"tika2":null}
